  {
   "text": "Figure 14. Reliability of the reported (mixed) model on the Wapiti survey-endpoint cohort: mean predicted new-burn\nprobability against mapped new-burn frequency in seven fixed bins (edges 0, 0.01, 0.02, 0.05, 0.1, 0.2, 0.5, 1; 275,961\ninitially unburned cell-interval entries, one fire). (b) enlarges the dashed region of (a). The lowest bin holds 93.91% of entries,\nwith mean prediction 0.0131% and observed frequency 0.3642%. Error bars: Wilson 95% intervals from the bin counts,\ncomputed for this figure. Source: preprint Table tab:endpointbins (wapiti_calibration_table.tex) and template.tex.",
